From 1a335c677c864327c45a9a726810554e2d86a6aa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DCS <claude@dcs.io>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 02:20:53 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] server: video index from immich-video-face

GET /api/assets/:id/appearances returns who is on screen when in a video, and
smart search also matches a video through CLIP embeddings of frames sampled
across it. Both read the schema that immich-video-face publishes to (ivf, or
IMMICH_VIDEO_INDEX_SCHEMA); without it they behave exactly as before.
